{
 "chunk": 37,
 "cat": "jar",
 "items": [
  {
   "i": 1,
   "en": "Any ships that aren't recovered will be scuttled, and any fitted weapons and fighter LPCs will be retrieved.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "en": "Close-range scans of the debris field reveal ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "en": "Closer inspection reveals ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "en": "If not recovered, the ship will be scuttled, and any fitted weapons and fighter LPCs will be retrieved.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "en": "Recoverable ships",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "en": "Salvage crews boarding the wreck discover that many essential systems are undamaged and the ship could be restored to basic functionality.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "en": "Salvage crews report ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "en": "Some time later, you hear back from your chief engineer, who mumbles about being a miracle worker to someone offscreen before noticing you've picked up the call.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "en": "Take a look at the chief engineer's report and make a decision",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "en": "The crew chief also reports that the hull has undergone %s, which appear to have survived its present state.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "en": "There are also indications that it has some sort of cargo on board.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "en": "Your crews find some securely stowed cargo during the recovery operation.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "en": "a ship",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "en": "floating near",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "en": "several ships",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "en": "special modifications",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/ShipRecoverySpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "en": "Attempt to open the pod",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SleeperPodsSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "en": "Attempt to open the pods",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SleeperPodsSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "en": "One by one, the pods begin to open as the thawing process completes. Most of the occupants come through alive, if somewhat dazed.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SleeperPodsSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "en": "One by one, the pods begin to open as the thawing process completes. Unfortunately, it's been too long, or something went wrong along the way, and there are no survivors - at least, not with any brain activity.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SleeperPodsSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "en": "The thawing process completes, and the pod opens. It contains an experienced officer, who joins you out of gratitude for being rescued.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SleeperPodsSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "en": "The thawing process completes, and the pod opens. It contains an experienced planetary administrator, who joins you out of gratitude for being rescued.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SleeperPodsSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "en": "While making a preliminary assessment, your salvage crews find a single occupied sleeper pod still running on backup power.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SleeperPodsSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "en": "While making a preliminary assessment, your salvage crews find some occupied mil-grade sleeper pods still running on backup power.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SleeperPodsSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "en": "While making a preliminary assessment, your salvage crews find some occupied sleeper pods still running on backup power.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SleeperPodsSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "en": " The world is notable for ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SurveyDataSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "en": " located ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SurveyDataSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "en": "The $shortName's memory banks are partially accessible, and contain full survey data for ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SurveyDataSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "en": "While exploring $aOrAn $nameInText, your crews found partially accessible memory banks that contain full survey data for ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SurveyDataSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "en": "Your salvage crews find a functional memory bank in the debris. It contains full survey data for ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SurveyDataSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "en": "being habitable.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SurveyDataSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "en": "having ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SurveyDataSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "en": "located ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/SurveyDataSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "en": "Your salvage crews find a partially-accessible data core that contains hyperspace topography data. The data is well out of date, but that makes it particularly valuable in extrapolating current trends.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/TopographicDataSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "en": "As your salvage crews begin their work, a transmitter hidden somewhere planetside sends out an encrypted, broadwave signal. Whatever destination it's meant for, it has to be nearby.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/TransmitterTrapSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "en": "As your salvage crews begin their work, a transmitter inside the $shortName sends out an encrypted, broadwave signal. Whatever destination it's meant for, it has to be nearby.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/TransmitterTrapSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "en": "Your salvage crews discover a transmitter set to send a signal when tripped by an alarm system, but it doesn't appear to be functional. Closer examination indicates it was probably set many cycles ago.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/TransmitterTrapSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "en": "Your salvage crews discover a transmitter set to send a signal when tripped by an alarm system. The alarm went off as intended, but the transmitter was fried by a power surge before it could do its job.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/rulecmd/salvage/special/TransmitterTrapSpecial.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "en": " (profit per unit: ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/shared/PlayerTradeProfitabilityData.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "en": " xp for selling ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/shared/PlayerTradeProfitabilityData.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "en": "Player accrued ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/shared/PlayerTradeProfitabilityData.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "en": "Wormhole Terminus ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/shared/WormholeManager.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "en": "wormhole terminus ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/shared/WormholeManager.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "en": "-50% kinetic damage taken by armor",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AdvancedCountermeasures$Level1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "en": "-25% high-explosive damage taken by shields",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AdvancedCountermeasures$Level2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "en": "+50% damage to fighters",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AdvancedCountermeasures$Level3A.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "en": "+50% damage to missiles",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AdvancedCountermeasures$Level3B.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "en": "    - Choose enough skills in lower tiers to unlock the next tier\n    - It's possible to skip a tier by taking more skills in lower tiers instead\n    - Reaching the top tier requires 4 skill points, plus 1 more to take one of the top skills\n    - Taking the second top tier skill requires an additional 2 points spent in lower tier skills\n    - Skills that only affect the piloted ship can be made \"elite\" at the cost of a ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AptitudeDesc$Level0.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "en": " point\n",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AptitudeDesc$Level0.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "en": "Skills that have been made elite in the past can be re-made elite at no cost\n",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AptitudeDesc$Level0.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "en": " for a Beta Core, and ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AutomatedShips$Level0.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "en": " for a Gamma Core. ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AutomatedShips$Level0.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "en": " for an Alpha Core, ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AutomatedShips$Level0.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "en": "*The total \"automated ship points\" are equal to the deployment points cost of all automated ships in the fleet, with a multiplier for installed AI cores - ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AutomatedShips$Level0.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "en": "Due to safety interlocks, ships with AI cores do not contribute to the deployment point distribution.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AutomatedShips$Level0.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "en": "do not contribute to the deployment point distribution",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AutomatedShips$Level0.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "en": " skill",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AutomatedShips$Level1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "en": "+%s combat readiness (maximum: %s); ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AutomatedShips$Level1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "en": "offsets built-in ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/skills/AutomatedShips$Level1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
